WEBVTT

00:00:09.015 --> 00:00:10.930
[sniffs]

00:00:15.021 --> 00:00:17.415
[deep breaths, exhales]

00:00:22.507 --> 00:00:23.377
[groans]

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:28.339
- Aah!
- [growls]

00:00:30.994 --> 00:00:33.431
OK. Thanks, bud.

00:00:41.308 --> 00:00:43.702
- [roaring]
- Aaah!

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:45.965
Toothless, stay here.

00:00:46.139 --> 00:00:47.184
[Snotlout] Come on, guys.
Get ready!

00:00:47.358 --> 00:00:49.142
Hold on tight! Here we go!

00:00:51.971 --> 00:00:53.277
What?

00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:58.282
[Vikings murmuring, faint]

00:01:01.372 --> 00:01:04.331
- I knew it. I'm dead.
- [laughs]

00:01:04.506 --> 00:01:09.162
No, but you gave it
your best shot.
So, what do you think?

00:01:09.336 --> 00:01:10.990
[man] Hey, look,
it's Hiccup!

00:01:12.209 --> 00:01:13.340
[woman] It's Hiccup!

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:19.216
Turns out all we needed
was a little more of this.

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:21.218
You just gestured
to all of me.

00:01:22.567 --> 00:01:25.570
Well, most of you.
That bit's my handiwork.

00:01:25.744 --> 00:01:29.226
With a little Hiccup flair
thrown in. You think it'll do?

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:31.924
- I might make a few tweaks.
- [laughter]

00:01:33.578 --> 00:01:35.406
- Aah!
- That's for scaring me.

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:37.843
What, is it always going
to be this way? 'Cause...

00:01:40.454 --> 00:01:42.369
...I could get used to it.

00:01:45.459 --> 00:01:47.244
- Welcome home.
- [door opens]

00:01:47.418 --> 00:01:49.551
- [man] Night Fury!
- Get down!

00:02:00.344 --> 00:02:03.086
- You ready?
- [growls]

00:02:04.261 --> 00:02:06.437
[Hiccup] This is Berk.

00:02:06.611 --> 00:02:10.528
It snows nine months
of the year and hails
the other three.

00:02:12.617 --> 00:02:15.533
Any food that grows here
is tough and tasteless.

00:02:17.491 --> 00:02:20.407
The people that grow here
are even more so.

00:02:20.582 --> 00:02:22.453
[dragons growling]

00:02:22.627 --> 00:02:24.150
Yeah!

00:02:24.324 --> 00:02:26.979
[Hiccup] The only upsides
are the pets.

00:02:29.286 --> 00:02:33.551
While other places
have ponies or parrots...

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:36.380
...we have...

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.512
...dragons.

00:02:38.687 --> 00:02:40.384
[Toothless roaring]

00:02:41.733 --> 00:02:45.432
[♪ Jonsi: Sticks & Stones]

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:51.525
♪ Eyes open wide,
blinded by the sun now ♪

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:54.441
♪ Orange and white,
dark red, green and yellow ♪

00:02:54.616 --> 00:02:58.184
♪ Rainbow colors
Do not hide, see the view ♪

00:02:58.358 --> 00:03:00.360
♪ Step aside, go through ♪

00:03:00.534 --> 00:03:03.015
♪ Against the light,
too strong, blow a fuse now ♪

00:03:03.189 --> 00:03:06.062
♪ Everything bright,
new songs, burning shoes ♪

00:03:06.236 --> 00:03:09.979
♪ The look in your eyes
Break your bones into half ♪

00:03:10.153 --> 00:03:13.286
♪ Scream and shout
and do laugh ♪

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:16.246
♪ Let yourself ♪

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.509
♪ Go ♪

00:03:18.683 --> 00:03:22.165
♪ Let yourself ♪

00:03:22.339 --> 00:03:26.169
♪ Go ♪

00:03:26.343 --> 00:03:29.259
♪ Stay close to me ♪

00:03:29.433 --> 00:03:32.349
♪ Count one, two, and three ♪

00:03:32.523 --> 00:03:35.265
♪ Up in through
your sleeves ♪

00:03:35.439 --> 00:03:38.224
♪ Bursting through the seams ♪

00:03:38.398 --> 00:03:44.491
♪ Open your eyes and see ♪

00:03:45.231 --> 00:03:51.150
♪ You see ♪

00:03:54.806 --> 00:03:57.591
[singing in Icelandic]

00:04:19.526 --> 00:04:24.662
♪ Let yourself go ♪

00:04:24.836 --> 00:04:28.231
♪ Let yourself ♪

00:04:28.405 --> 00:04:32.452
♪ Go ♪

00:04:32.626 --> 00:04:35.368
♪ Stay close to me ♪

00:04:35.542 --> 00:04:38.241
♪ Count one, two and three ♪

00:04:38.415 --> 00:04:41.374
♪ Up in through your sleeves ♪

00:04:41.548 --> 00:04:44.290
♪ Bursting through the seams ♪

00:04:44.464 --> 00:04:49.513
♪ Open your eyes and see ♪

